		{
			"id": "eRutpOgQVrMkd21y0",
			"description": "Omnissian Staff",
			"local_notes": "This is a powered ritual staff, not a psyker's force stave; the psyker variant belongs to the psychic-gear file, not here.\n\nLore: A two-handed ritual staff carried by Magi and senior Tech-Priests who favour reach and a quarterstaff's defensive profile over a one-handed blade; depicted throughout current Codex Adeptus Mechanicus background as functionally interchangeable with the Omnissian Axe in combat effect, the choice between the two being a matter of the individual Tech-Priest's training and station.\n\nDesign: Mechanically identical to the Imperium Power Stave (same power-field rule applied to a two-handed quarterstaff baseline), for the same reason the Omnissian Axe above matches the Power Axe: this project treats the disruption field itself as a fixed, faction-neutral technology once established, so the only things that vary between an Ecclesiarchy Power Stave and this Mechanicus-forged Omnissian Staff are cost, legality and the ritual it's blessed with, not its numbers.",
