			"quantity": 1
		},
		{
			"id": "e4_8LREhhNv0EzVB4",
			"description": "Taser Goad",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The organic-focused counterpart to the arc goad, built to incapacitate an unruly menial or a heretic under interrogation rather than to correct machinery; depicted in Inquisitorial and Mechanicus background as standard-issue crowd-control and discipline gear wherever the Cult Mechanicus polices its own.\n\nDesign: Identical thr cr baseline to the Power Goad and Arc Goad, but with the full HT-3 stun setting the Imperium Shock Maul uses (rather than the Power Goad's milder HT-2), reflecting a purpose-built taser rather than a general correctional prod - this project treats \"taser\" and \"shock\" as the same underlying electro-stun mechanic wherever it appears, per the Shock Maul's own precedent, rather than inventing a new effect for each named variant.",
