					},
					"reach": "1,2*,3*",
					"parry": "-1",
					"strength": "11",
					"usage": "Mounted charge",
					"usage_notes": "A hit that does any HP of damage forces the target to roll HT-3 or be stunned (B420), as the Taser Goad. The full mounted-charge reach and damage bonus (marked *) requires a Sydonian Dragoon or Ironstrider-class walker chassis (or an actual mount) moving at speed, per the Imperium Power Lance's own charge rule.\n",
